00:39:58,590 --> 00:40:03,150
For many, many, many application domains and in many, many, many situations, it's overkill.

613
00:40:03,150 --> 00:40:09,270
Like Like you you actually find almost all the bugs with much simpler methods once you've got some.

614
00:40:09,270 --> 00:40:11,390
decent randomness in there and some decent fault injection.

615
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:17,830
But we are currently doing some very cool research with this.

