00:42:32,080 --> 00:42:35,310
I would say those are the main categories of limitations.

651
00:42:35,320 --> 00:42:41,910
I want to contrast it with one I don't want to call it technique, but one different idea.

652
00:42:41,910 --> 00:42:47,590
If, let's say, programmers or libraries or developers could annotate or or inject annotations in their code base,

